    {
      "id": "p0204-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A cat monster named \"Catty\" and an alligator monster named \"Bratty\" run a shop in a back alley. Because the English word \"bratty\" isn’t well known in Japan, Bratty was renamed \"Alligetty\" in Japanese. Early on, Toby was informed that ブラッティ (buratti, \"Bratty\") might also look confusingly similar to ブラッディ (buraddi, \"bloody\"), which is a well-known English word in Japan.",
        "raw": "A cat monster named \"Catty\" and an alligator monster named \"Bratty\" run\na shop in a back alley. Because the English word \"bratty\" isn't well known\nin Japan, Bratty was renamed \"Alligetty\" in Japanese. Early on, Toby was\ninformed that f 7'/T1 (buratti, \"Bratty\") might also look confusingly similar\nto 7''7rf'1 (buraddi, \"bloody\"), which is a well-known English word in Japan.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en",
          "ja"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28948099,
          0.26434286,
          0.89399198,
          0.34847143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2874541,
          0.26362857,
          0.89640398,
          0.34954286
