      "id": "p0204-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Bra tty's name happens to appear on a faint background banner in one scene. To reflect her new name in Japanese, the localization team crafted a new banner that spells \"Alligetty\", then modified the game's core programming to display the proper banner based on the player's language settings.",
